WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.7 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
Monitoring: planned versus actual

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Monitoring compares what you planned with what is actually happening, from your first activity.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Record planned, actual and the gap for each period.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Ask why before you react to a gap.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Share a simple traffic-light view with co-founders.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You design your monitoring dashboard and review routine.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
